+      <t indent="0" pn="section-3-10">Note that this attack is much more serious in IPv6 than in IPv4.  In
+IPv4, the overlapping part of the TCP header does not include the
+source and destination ports.  In IPv6, the attack can easily work to
+replace the source or destination port with an overlapping fragment.</t>
